first we need to 
(1) de novo identify the TE for the acropora using the longrepmasker (follow the tutorial from https://github.com/BioinformaticsCSU/LongRepMarker)

(2) used the predicted sequence as input to the repeatmasker to do the annotation (follow the tutorial from https://github.com/Dfam-consortium/RepeatMasker)

(3) run kallisto to map the sc-seq data into TE reference (see the slurm file)

(4) downstream analysis of the TE expression (see the ipython file and the post analysis R files)
